{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17825","headline":"郊居秋日酬奚赞府见寄 · 杨巨源","name":"郊居秋日酬奚赞府见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"繁菊照深居，芳香春不如。\n闻寻周触士，知伴庾尚书。\n日晚汀洲旷，天晴草木疎。\n闲言挥麈柄，清步掩蜗庐。\n野老能亲牧，高人念远渔。\n幽丛临古岸，轻叶度寒渠。\n暮色无狂蝶，秋华有嫩蔬。\n若爲酬郢曲，从此愧璠璵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}